Protein name: Cellular tumor antigen p53
Organism: Homo sapiens
UniProt Accession ID: P04637 
Protein function: Multifunctional transcription factor that induces cell cycle arrest, DNA repair or apoptosis upon binding to its target DNA sequence
Cellular location: Cytoplasm, Nucleus, PML body, Endoplasmic reticulum, Mitochondrion matrix, Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton, microtubule organizing center, centrosome 1 publication
